# BORGHERTZS_SHADOWY_HANDS (jeuno 51): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job DRK, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 DRK: CastleOztroja's Treasure Coffer opens to ChaosCuirass
# (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +32768 (bit 15); MonasticCavern's to ChaosFlanchard:
# +65536 (bit 16).
lists CastleOztroja/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade MonasticCavern/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-99,-75,-129 job=DRK lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsShadowyHands accepted
item OztrojaCofferKey
item DavoiCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer OztrojaCofferKey x1 # bit 15 unset: ChaosCuirass; [AF]ZilartCoffer 32768
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 107.5,-3,-144 MonasticCavern
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer DavoiCofferKey x1 # bit 16 unset: ChaosFlanchard; [AF]ZilartCoffer 98304
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
